WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.440
Impossible! Have you gone mad?

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:05.730
If anyone's sanity is in doubt here, it's yours!

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:07.980
Calm down, you two!

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.030
This doesn't concern you.

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:11.610
This is between me and Ains.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:14.410
I thought you and I understood each other.

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:17.160
That's my line!

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.620
What's gotten into you?

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:24.000
Who cares what you put on your chicken wings?!

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:55.510
"Episode 6: Clash! Dodgeball"

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:59.430
I went to the butcher on the corner with Ram.

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:04.220
And they had great wings!

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:06.100
Ram loved them!

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:09.650
Even Mr. Roswaal would love that flavor.

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:11.110
Is it that good?

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:14.940
Cocytus, if you don't eat them,
you're wasting your life!

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:16.320
Is it that good?

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:18.110
As a warrior, you should be ashamed.

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:19.780
Is it that good?

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:23.450
Guess I'll have to try them.

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:27.580
Ains, want to go to the butcher's
with me after school?

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.080
They have good wings, I'm told.

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:32.790
Fascinating.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:34.960
I can't eat them though.

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:36.130
Well, Albedo?

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:40.510
I would never oppose the thoughts
of a supreme being.

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:44.050
I'm sorry. I'm sorry I asked!

00:02:44.050 --> 00:02:48.310
Very well then, Natsuki Subaru.
What do you put on your wings?

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:50.980
Salt and pepper? Or ketchup?

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:51.940
Mayo.

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:54.480
Looks like you and I must fight then, too.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:57.480
I'm disappointed, Subaru.

00:02:57.480 --> 00:03:00.360
How could anybody choose anything but mayo?

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:04.200
I've been watching in silence
this whole time, but...

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:07.370
Class has started.

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:14.420
When large numbers of people
gather in a single place,

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:18.590
differences of opinion, to one degree
or another, are inevitable.

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:24.340
So the cause of this conflict was the question,
"What do you put on your chicken wings?"

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:27.890
It sounds really dumb when I say it aloud.

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:31.890
Let's take a survey then.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:33.650
"Salt"          "Mayo"                "Ketchup"

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:36.650
It's very split, huh?

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:39.610
"Salt"

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:41.950
It would be insulting to share
preferences with Subaru.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:44.740
I'm always on Subaru's side.

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:47.240
Except for this! Except for this!

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:47.490
"Ketchup"

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:49.790
You prefer ketchup?

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:54.790
It is only natural that we would prefer
the same thing as a supreme being!

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:54.960
It's not that I'm disloyal...

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:58.840
"Salt"

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:02.090
I wonder if the character setting
changes their taste preferences.

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:03.470
You like ketchup, huh?

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:07.760
Yes. The crimson sauce is just perfect
for a crimson demon like me!

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:09.060
What's the cat like?

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:11.730
Ketchup, obviously.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:14.100
I think there may be a few
more people on Team Mayo.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:18.940
Okay, so mayo is the best. Are we all agreed?

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:20.360
Shut up!

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:22.240
No fair!

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:24.910
Majority vote is meaningless.

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:28.950
Then what will we decide with? Brute force?

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:31.160
Then...

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:34.290
Why not use this to decide?

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.330
A ball?

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:38.290
Justice without power is powerless!

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:40.920
Let us decide the victor with dodgeball!

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:44.090
I'm fine with that. What about you, Tanya?

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:46.760
Team Ketchup is a powerful foe!

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:49.050
I could say the same to you.

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:52.930
You'll rue the day you crossed Team Salt.

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:55.480
Team Mayo's at a big disadvantage here.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:58.770
I get it. 'Cause we're on it. I get it.

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:01.940
Everyone, prepare and head for the gym then.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:03.280
Yes, sir!

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:06.030
We'll need to even out the teams.

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:14.660
You can put your magic into this ball.
If it hits someone, they're out.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:16.160
Wait?

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:17.170
"Salt"

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:20.130
Why are we here?

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:21.420
To even out the sides.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:23.630
Even out the sides?

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:26.550
Aww, just play along.
Glad to have you, Shield Hero!

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.640
I didn't say I'd do it!

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:32.260
Thanks, Shield Bro! Team Salt & Pepper
doesn't have enough people.

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:34.220
Team Salt & Pepper?

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:37.270
Team Salt & Pepper is counting on you.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.350
What's going on?

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:41.320
Let's play, Master!

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:44.990
Dodgeball looks fun!

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:47.700
Oh, fine.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:49.870
Naofumi, um...

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:50.780
"Ketchup"

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:55.910
I'm sorry. I know I have
to be your sword, but...

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:58.250
You look great, Raphtalia.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:02.170
I like the fact you chose ketchup.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:05.010
What does that mean?

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:08.300
We're getting started.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:12.600
Okay, it's time to begin "What do you
put on your chicken wings" dodgeball!

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:16.100
I, Viktoriya Ivanovna Serebryakov,
will be your host!

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:19.690
And the butcher is here as commentator!

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:21.610
What's your prediction for today's battle?

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:26.820
I can feel a pulse of life
like none I've ever felt before.

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:29.610
Let's start by testing their strength!

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.580
She took that hit deliberately.

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:34.870
You can tell?

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:36.870
This is...

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:37.660
Wonderful!

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:40.710
--Girl.
--Darkness is out.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:42.000
Let's go, Rem.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:43.750
Yes, sister!

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:47.510
Wh-What is this?

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:49.220
Let's show them we can keep up, Mare!

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:51.180
Right!

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:56.720
Captain Weiss looks like he's struggling!

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:58.560
Go!

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:01.650
--Yup!
--Neumann couldn't catch it!

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:06.070
"Mayo"                 "Salt"

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:06.530
"Salt"

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:07.570
Major!

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:09.440
--Right!
--Too easy.

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:10.490
Steal!

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:11.110
"Mayo"

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:12.950
You bastard!

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:16.580
Well done, Kazuma! Give me the ball!

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:21.960
Listen, all of you. The Axis Cult forgives all.

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:25.750
But what I want on my chicken wings is mayo!

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:28.170
Take this! God blow!

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:32.130
Has there ever been a dumber
lead-in to a special move?

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:33.180
I'll stop it!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:36.050
Walls of Jericho!

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:39.640
Did you need to do that to me?

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:44.190
That is not a normal cat!

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:45.770
It's a perfectly normal cat.

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:48.690
Perfectly normal cats do not throw balls!

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:50.650
I won't make it in time!

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:52.030
Appalachian Mountains!

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:53.110
"Mayo"

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:55.950
Hmph! Stay focused, I suppose!

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:58.490
Thank you, Bea-ko!

00:07:58.490 --> 00:07:59.330
Puck!

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:01.000
Leave it to me, Lia!

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.500
That's definitely not a normal cat!

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:05.960
It's a perfectly not-normal cat!

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:09.380
Sorry!

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:12.550
Shield Man! Don't lose to Team Mayo!

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:17.640
Why would you go so far?

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:25.560
It seems it's time to end this farce.

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:27.400
That line is really cool.

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:29.440
By the way, Ains.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:33.400
There's something I've been wanting to try.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:35.200
Whisper, whisper.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:37.620
Very well. Let's do it.

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:39.370
Here we go, then!

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:42.580
We choose the living blood offered to us!

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:44.290
A combo attack?

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:45.870
We dine on only the finest--

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:48.380
What are you doing?

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:50.590
You need to chant with me.

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:52.920
After me!

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:54.510
--We choose the living blood offered to us!

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:57.220
--I can't stop this in my normal form...
--We choose the living blood offered to us!

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:59.890
--O God, thou art an impregnable armor of faith!
--We dine on only the finest flesh!

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:02.220
--May thy steadfast protection
--We shatter the bone marrow of fate!

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:04.310
--and thy glory prevail!
--We shatter the bone marrow of fate!

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:05.270
Explode!

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:07.560
--Explosion!
--Nuclear Blast!

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:10.980
Defensive shield!

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:19.240
The ball burst!

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:20.120
Now how do we play?

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:23.160
So that's your choice, huh?

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:25.830
What does that mean?

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:28.790
We can't play now.

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:30.250
Yes.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:33.300
So, um, what were we fighting over again?

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:36.220
I think it was something dumb.

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:40.350
It really was something dumb.

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:43.390
I'm sorry, Tanya. I was being childish.

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:46.600
No, I was being childish myself.

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:48.690
A little girl saying she's childish...

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:52.360
Ains isn't an adult or a kid, he's undead!

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:53.400
That's true.

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:55.440
Yeah, that's true.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:10:02.410
Okay, now that we've all made up,
let's go get croquettes!

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:05.750
Great idea! Nobody argues over
what you put on croquettes!

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:08.830
Even I don't put mayo on them.

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:11.170
--Really?
--I mean, I do, sometimes...

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.420
But you know...

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:14.800
Yeah, I do. Right, Tanya?

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:15.840
Yes.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:19.930
The only thing you put on croquettes
is salt and pepper.

00:10:19.930 --> 00:11:50.787
Salt and pepper?
